exports[`página de inicio > renderiza igual que antes 1`] = `"<div class="min-h-screen bg-white"><nav class="bg-white shadow-sm sticky top-0 z-50"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="flex justify-between items-center h-16"><a class="flex items-center space-x-2" href="/"><img src="/logo.png" alt="Banqueando" class="h-10 w-10 object-contain"><span class="text-xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-purple-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Banqueando</span></a><div class="hidden md:flex items-center space-x-8"><a class="text-gray-700 hover:text-cyan-600 font-medium transition-colors" href="/">Inicio</a><div class="relative"><button class="flex items-center text-gray-700 hover:text-cyan-600 font-medium transition-colors">Productos<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 transition-transform "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div><a href="#como-funciona" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-cyan-600 font-medium transition-colors">Cómo Funciona</a><a href="#beneficios" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-cyan-600 font-medium transition-colors">Beneficios</a><a class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-purple-600 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-bold hover:shadow-lg transition-all" href="/quiz">Empezar Quiz</a></div><div class="md:hidden flex items-center space-x-3"><a class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-purple-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-bold text-sm" href="/quiz">Quiz</a><button class="text-gray-700 hover:text-cyan-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-6 h-6"><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></nav><section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white pt-20 pb-32"><div class="absolute top-0 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-50"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-purple-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-50"></div><div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center mb-8"><div class="inline-flex items-center bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-50 to-purple-50 border border-cyan-200 rounded-full px-4 py-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 mr-2"><path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"></path><path d="M5 3v4"></path><path d="M19 17v4"></path><path d="M3 5h4"></path><path d="M17 19h4"></path></svg><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">IA personalizada • Tarjetas + Crédito • 2,847 usuarios</span></div></div><div class="text-center mb-12"><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">¿Qué decisión financiera<br><span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-purple-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">necesitas tomar hoy?</span></h1><p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Elige tu necesidad y encuentra tu match perfecto en 2 minutos</p></div><div class="hidden md:grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border-2 border-cyan-400 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-cyan-500/20 transition-all hover:scale-105"><div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-cyan-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-8 h-8 text-white"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"></rect><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Tarjetas de Crédito</h3><p class="text-cyan-600 font-semibold mb-4">Comparamos todas las tarjetas y te mostramos la mejor para ti</p><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Analizamos tarjetas de bancos y fintechs en Colombia. Según tu ingreso, historial y forma de uso, <strong class="text-gray-800">te mostramos las tarjetas que realmente te convienen y puedes obtener.</strong></p><div class="space-y-3 mb-6"><div class="flex items-start text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-500 mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><path d="M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-sm">Comparamos tarjetas de <strong>bancos y fintechs</strong></span></div><div class="flex items-start text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-500 mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><path d="M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-sm">Filtramos las que <strong>sí aplican a tu perfil</strong></span></div><div class="flex items-start text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-500 mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><path d="M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-sm">Te mostramos la <strong>mejor opción para ti</strong></span></div></div><a class="block w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-cyan-600 text-white py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg text-center hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-cyan-500/50 transition-all transform hover:scale-105" href="/quiz">👉 Encontrar mi tarjeta ideal</a><p class="text-center text-gray-500 text-sm mt-3">⏱️ 2 minutos • 🔒 Gratis y seguro</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border-2 border-purple-400 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-purple-500/20 transition-all hover:scale-105"><div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-purple-700 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-8 h-8 text-white"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Créditos</h3><p class="text-purple-600 font-semibold mb-4">Comparamos todos los créditos y te mostramos la mejor opción para ti</p><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Analizamos créditos personales y para negocios, en bancos y fintechs. Según tu necesidad y perfil, <strong class="text-gray-800">te mostramos las opciones más viables para ti.</strong></p><div class="space-y-3 mb-6"><div class="flex items-start text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-500 mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><path d="M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-sm"><strong>Créditos personales y para negocio</strong></span></div><div class="flex items-start text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-500 mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><path d="M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-sm">Comparamos <strong>bancos + fintechs</strong></span></div><div class="flex items-start text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-500 mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><path d="M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-sm">Te mostramos el crédito <strong>más viable para ti</strong></span></div></div><a class="block w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-purple-700 text-white py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg text-center hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-purple-500/50 transition-all transform hover:scale-105" href="/quiz">👉 Encontrar mi crédito ideal</a><p class="text-center text-gray-500 text-sm mt-3">⏱️ 3 minutos • 🔒 Gratis y seguro</p></div></div><div class="md:hidden"><div class="text-center mb-8"><p class="text-gray-900 font-bold text-xl mb-6">¿Qué necesitas hoy?</p><div class="flex items-center justify-center mb-8"><div class="w-1 h-12 bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-400 to-purple-400"></div></div></div><div class="space-y-6"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-cyan-400 shadow-lg"><div class="flex items-center mb-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-cyan-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mr-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-6 h-6 text-white"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"></rect><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Tarjetas</h3></div><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">Comparamos todas las tarjetas y te mostramos la mejor para ti. Bancos y fintechs.</p><a class="block w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-cyan-600 text-white py-3 rounded-full font-bold text-center" href="/quiz">👉 Encontrar mi tarjeta</a></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><div class="w-1 h-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-400/50 to-purple-400/50"></div></div><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-purple-400 shadow-lg"><div class="flex items-center mb-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-purple-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mr-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-6 h-6 text-white"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Créditos</h3></div><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">Comparamos todos los créditos y te mostramos la mejor opción. Personales y para negocio.</p><a class="block w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-purple-700 text-white py-3 rounded-full font-bold text-center" href="/quiz">👉 Encontrar mi crédito</a></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-6 mt-8 text-sm text-gray-600"><div class="flex items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-4 h-4 mr-2 text-cyan-600"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg><span>2-3 min</span></div><div class="flex items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-4 h-4 mr-2 text-purple-600"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg><span>100% seguro</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 bg-white border-y border-gray-100"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center"><div><div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-purple-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-2">2,847</div><div class="text-gray-600 font-medium text-sm md:text-base">Usuarios este mes</div></div><div><div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-purple-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-2">35%</div><div class="text-gray-600 font-medium text-sm md:text-base">Personas financiadas</div></div><div><div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-purple-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-2">4.9/5</div><div class="text-gray-600 font-medium text-sm md:text-base">Satisfacción promedio</div></div><div><div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-purple-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-2">2 min</div><div class="text-gray-600 font-medium text-sm md:text-base">Tiempo promedio</div></div></div></div></section><section id="problema" class="py-20 bg-gray-50"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">68% de los colombianos no tiene claro cuál es<span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-purple-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent"> el producto adecuado para él</span></h2><p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">No es por falta de opciones. Es por <strong>falta de claridad al comparar</strong>.</p></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center"><div class="space-y-6"><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-red-500 shadow-sm"><div class="flex items-start"><div class="bg-red-100 p-3 rounded-lg mr-4 flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-red-600"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">No sabes si tu tarjeta es realmente la mejor del mercado</h3><p class="text-gray-600">Elegiste tu tarjeta hace años por comodidad o porque te la ofreció tu banco. Pero el mercado cambió: hay nuevas opciones con mejores beneficios.</p></div></div></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-red-500 shadow-sm"><div class="flex items-start"><div class="bg-red-100 p-3 rounded-lg mr-4 flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-red-600"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Comparas solo por tasa o cuota, ignorando lo que realmente importa</h3><p class="text-gray-600">Te enfocas en un solo factor sin considerar el panorama completo: beneficios, programa de puntos, seguros incluidos, alianzas comerciales.</p></div></div></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-red-500 shadow-sm"><div class="flex items-start"><div class="bg-red-100 p-3 rounded-lg mr-4 flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-red-600"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">No sabes si necesitas tarjeta o crédito</h3><p class="text-gray-600">Financias compras grandes con tarjeta cuando un préstamo tendría mejor tasa. O pides crédito cuando una tarjeta con beneficios sería más conveniente.</p></div></div></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-red-500 shadow-sm"><div class="flex items-start"><div class="bg-red-100 p-3 rounded-lg mr-4 flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-red-600"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Tu banco te ofrece "lo que tiene", no lo que necesitas</h3><p class="text-gray-600">Tu asesor bancario te muestra solo los productos de SU entidad. Nunca comparas con otras 15 opciones del mercado.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-purple-600 p-10 rounded-3xl text-white shadow-2xl"><div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 rounded-2xl"><h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">La solución: Match financiero personalizado</h3><div class="space-y-4 mb-8"><div class="flex items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-6 h-6 text-cyan-300 mr-3 flex-shrink-0"><path d="M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-lg">Comparamos TODO el mercado (no solo un banco)</span></div><div class="flex items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-6 h-6 text-cyan-300 mr-3 flex-shrink-0"><path d="M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-lg">Analizamos TU situación real (no promedios genéricos)</span></div><div class="flex items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-6 h-6 text-cyan-300 mr-3 flex-shrink-0"><path d="M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-lg">Te mostramos POR QUÉ cada opción te conviene</span></div></div><div class="bg-white/20 p-4 rounded-xl text-center"><div class="text-4xl font-black mb-2">$450K</div><div class="text-cyan-100">Ahorro promedio por año al optimizar tu producto financiero</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="como-funciona" class="py-20 bg-white"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Cómo funciona Banqueando</h2><p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">Dos productos, un mismo proceso inteligente</p></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-purple-50 p-8 rounded-3xl border-2 border-cyan-200"><div class="text-center mb-8"><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-purple-600 rounded-2xl mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-8 h-8 text-white"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"></rect><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Tarjetas de Crédito</h3></div><div class="space-y-6"><div class="flex items-start"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold mr-4">1</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Quiz 2 minutos</h4><p class="text-gray-600">Estilo de vida + hábitos de pago</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold mr-4">2</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Algoritmo analiza tu perfil</h4><p class="text-gray-600">15+ variables personales</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold mr-4">3</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Top 3 tarjetas con score</h4><p class="text-gray-600">Razones personalizadas del match</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold mr-4">4</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Aplicas directo al banco</h4><p class="text-gray-600">Seguimiento del proceso de aprobación</p></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-amber-50 p-8 rounded-3xl border-2 border-purple-200"><div class="text-center mb-8"><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-amber-500 rounded-2xl mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-8 h-8 text-white"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Crédito para ti o tu negocio</h3></div><div class="space-y-6"><div class="flex items-start"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-purple-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold mr-4">1</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Quiz 3 minutos</h4><p class="text-gray-600">Situación + necesidad + capacidad</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-purple-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold mr-4">2</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Algoritmo evalúa tu caso</h4><p class="text-gray-600">20+ variables de viabilidad</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-purple-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold mr-4">3</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Top 3 opciones de crédito</h4><p class="text-gray-600">Tasas + plazos + montos comparados</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-purple-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold mr-4">4</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Conectamos con entidades</h4><p class="text-gray-600">Pre-aprobación rápida y seguimiento</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="beneficios" class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-gray-100"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Por qué usar Banqueando</h2><p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">La plataforma que te ayuda a tomar mejores decisiones financieras.</p></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow"><div class="bg-cyan-100 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-7 h-7 text-cyan-600"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">100% Personalizado</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">No recomendamos productos al azar. Cada sugerencia está basada en tu perfil único y necesidades reales.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow"><div class="bg-green-100 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-7 h-7 text-green-600"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Ahorra Dinero</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Te mostramos exactamente cuánto ahorrarás en cuotas, tasas y beneficios vs. otras opciones.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow"><div class="bg-purple-100 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-7 h-7 text-purple-600"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Totalmente Gratis</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Sin costos ocultos, sin comisiones. Nuestro servicio es 100% gratuito para ti.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow"><div class="bg-amber-100 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-7 h-7 text-amber-600"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Tecnología IA</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Algoritmo inteligente que aprende de miles de perfiles para darte la mejor recomendación.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-100 to-purple-100 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-7 h-7 text-purple-600"><polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"></polygon><polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"></polyline><polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Dos soluciones, una plataforma</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Desde tarjetas personales hasta crédito para tu negocio. Todo tu ecosistema financiero en un solo lugar.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-100 to-amber-100 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-7 h-7 text-amber-600"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"></path><path d="m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"></path><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0"></path><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Pensado para crecer</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Especialmente diseñado para emprendedores, freelancers y negocios en crecimiento que buscan financiamiento inteligente.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-white"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Preguntas Frecuentes</h2><p class="text-xl text-gray-600">Todo lo que necesitas saber antes de empezar</p></div><div class="space-y-4"><details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">¿Realmente es gratis? ¿Cómo se sostienen?</h3><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">100% gratis para ti. Los bancos y fintechs nos pagan una comisión si decides aplicar a través de nosotros (tú pagas lo mismo que si fueras directo). Esto nos permite ser independientes y recomendarte LO QUE REALMENTE TE CONVIENE, no lo que más nos paga.</p></details><details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">¿En qué se diferencian de otros comparadores?</h3><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Ellos te muestran una tabla con todos los productos para que TÚ compares manualmente. Nosotros hacemos un match 1-a-1 basado en TU perfil específico. No un ranking genérico de "los 10 mejores" que no consideran tu situación única.</p></details><details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">¿Mis datos están seguros? ¿Comparten mi información?</h3><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Tus datos están encriptados y NUNCA se comparten con terceros sin tu consentimiento explícito. El quiz es anónimo. Solo si decides aplicar a un producto, te redirigimos a la entidad con los datos que tú autorices.</p></details><details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">¿Ustedes aprueban la tarjeta o el crédito?</h3><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">No. Somos un comparador, no un banco. Te recomendamos las mejores opciones para ti y te conectamos con la entidad. Ellos deciden si aprueban basados en su análisis de riesgo. Nuestro quiz pre-filtra para mostrarte solo productos donde tienes alta probabilidad de aprobación según tu perfil.</p></details><details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">¿Qué pasa si ya tengo tarjeta?</h3><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">¡Perfecto! El 80% de nuestros usuarios ya tienen tarjeta. Te mostraremos opciones mejores para tu perfil. Puedes tener varias tarjetas (es normal y hasta recomendable) y usar cada una para lo que mejor optimiza.</p></details><details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">¿Cuánto tarda el proceso completo?</h3><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">El quiz: 2-3 minutos. Aplicar a la entidad: 5-10 minutos. Aprobación: 24-72 horas (algunos fintechs aprueban en minutos). Desembolso de crédito: 24-48 horas según la entidad.</p></details><details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">¿Qué tipos de crédito comparan?</h3><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Comparamos múltiples opciones: líneas de crédito, crédito de capital de trabajo, financiamiento de facturas, crédito para inventario, préstamos para expansión, y crédito de consumo. Dependiendo de tu perfil, te mostramos las opciones más compatibles.</p></details><details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">¿Necesito ser empresa formal o también aplica para informales?</h3><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Trabajamos con ambos. Tenemos opciones para empresas formalmente constituidas (SAS, Ltda, etc) y también para emprendedores e informales con ingresos demostrables. El quiz determina qué opciones aplican para tu caso específico.</p></details><details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 pr-4">¿Qué información necesito para el quiz de crédito?</h3><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Información básica: situación actual, antigüedad (personal o del negocio), ingresos mensuales aproximados, y para qué necesitas el crédito. No necesitas estados financieros ni documentos para el quiz. Solo los pedimos si decides aplicar a una opción específica.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-purple-600"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center"><h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">¿Listo para optimizar tus finanzas?</h2><p class="text-xl text-cyan-50 mb-8">Más de 2,847 personas y negocios encontraron su solución financiera ideal este mes.<br><strong class="text-white">Tarjeta personal o crédito. ¿Cuál necesitas hoy?</strong></p><a class="inline-flex items-center bg-white text-cyan-600 px-10 py-5 rounded-full font-bold text-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all transform hover:scale-105" href="/quiz">Empezar Ahora<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="ml-3 w-6 h-6"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><p class="text-cyan-100 mt-6 text-sm flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-4 h-4 mr-2"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>Tus datos son privados y nunca se comparten con terceros</p></div></section><footer class="bg-gray-900 text-white"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8"><div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2"><a class="flex items-center space-x-2 mb-4" href="/"><div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-purple-600 p-2 rounded-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-6 h-6 text-white"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"></rect><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg></div><span class="text-xl font-bold">Banqueando</span></a><p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 max-w-md">Encuentra la tarjeta de crédito perfecta para ti. Comparamos todas las opciones del mercado para que tomes la mejor decisión financiera.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-bold mb-4">Producto</h3><ul class="space-y-2"><li><a class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/quiz">Quiz Inteligente</a></li><li><a href="#como-funciona" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">Cómo Funciona</a></li><li><a href="#beneficios" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">Beneficios</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="font-bold mb-4">Legal</h3><ul class="space-y-2"><li><a href="#" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">Términos y Condiciones</a></li><li><a href="#" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">Política de Privacidad</a></li><li><a href="#" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">Contacto</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="border-t border-gray-800 mt-8 pt-8 text-center text-gray-400 text-sm"><p>© 2026 Banqueando. Todos los derechos reservados.</p><p class="mt-2">Comparador independiente de tarjetas de crédito en Colombia 🇨🇴</p></div></div></footer></div>"`;
